hadiths[12]{hadithnumber,text}:
"386","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nubaishah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak ham tumhen us ke goshton [qurbani ke janwaron] se teen din se upar mana karte the yahan tak ke tumhen wus'at de; to khao aur zakheera karo. Khabardar, beshak yeh din khane aur peene ke din hain.'"
"387","[AI-translation] Umar bin Hakam (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas ko Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki masjid mein bayan karte suna. Unhon ne kaha: [Nabi Sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya]: 'Tum zaroor tum se pehle walon ki sunnat [tareeqe] par sawar hoge: Us ki meethi aur kadwi [achchai aur burai mein un ki pairwi karoge].'"
"388","[AI-translation] Umar bin Abdul-Aziz (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Banu Israil ka mamla seedha raha yahan tak ke un mein qaidi aurton ki aulad [jo dusri qaumon se mayen thin] paida hui; unhon ne un mein rae se fatwe diye; woh gumrah hue aur gumrah kiya."
"389","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Waqid Laisi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek darakht ke paas se guzre jis par mushrik apne hathiyar latkate the; use Zaat Anwath kaha jata tha. To ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hamare liye Zaat Anwath bana den jaise un ke paas Zaat Anwath hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yeh waisa hai jaisa Banu Israil ne kaha: Hamare liye mabood bana de jaise un ke mabood hain.'"
"390","[AI-translation] Yahya bin Sa'id (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Woh Musalman ki diyat mein bakriyon mein se do hazar bakriyan dete."
"391","[AI-translation] Yahya bin Sa'id (Rahimahullah) se Amr bin Shu'aib se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne diyat ke bare mein kaha: 'Bakri walon par [wajib] bakriyan hain.'"
"392","[AI-translation] Yahya bin Sa'id (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Qasim bin Muhammad se us bae ka zikr kiya jo ham ek yateem ke liye bechte the jo meri kafalat mein tha: Ham ek aadmi se khana aur tel muqarrara muddat tak maloom qeemat par bechte; jab ham us ke bechne se farigh hote to ek aadmi jata aur us ke liye khana aur charbi khareedta, phir use pura ada karta. To Qasim ne kaha: 'Ham is mein koi harj nahin samajhte the yahan tak ke ameer ne us se mana farmaya; jab us ne us se mana farmaya to main use pasand nahin karta.'"
"393","[AI-translation] Abu Aun A'war (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne khabar di ke Abud-Darda kaha karte: 'Main zameen mein jis raat bhi raha phir subah is haal mein ki ke logon ne mujh par us mein koi museebat [ilzam] nahin dali, magar main ne apne par Allah ki nemat dekhi.'"
"394","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se Allah Azz wa Jall ke farman: ﴿وَالْمُحْصَنَاتُ مِنَ النِّسَاءِ إِلَّا مَا مَلَكَتْ أَيْمَانُكُمْ﴾ [An-Nisa: 24] ke bare mein riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: 'Jangi qaidiyan jin ke shauhar qaid hone se pehle the phir woh halal ki gayin [istibra ke ba'd].'"
"395","[AI-translation] Abu Iyas Mu'awiyah bin Qurrah (Rahimahullah) se Hazrat Abu Ayyub [Ansari Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke unhon ne tairti hui [mari] machhli khai."
"396","[AI-translation] Abu Qilabah (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba ne apne beton ka zikr kiya aur kaha: Hamare bete ham se behtar hain; woh Islam mein paida hue aur unhon ne Allah ke sath ek lamha bhi shirk nahin kiya. Jab yeh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak pahuncha to Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak Allah Azz wa Jall ne mujhe meri ummat ke behtareen mein bheja; ham apne beton se behtar hain, hamare bete un ke beton se behtar hain, aur un ke bete un ke beton se behtar hain.'"
"397","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ibrahim bin Haris Taimi (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ba'z bastiyon se khajoor aur jau aae; Banu Zufar ke do gharon ne Usaid bin Hudair se kaha: Hamari hajat Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se zikr karo. Usaid bin Hudair Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur Aap ke paas qaum ko paya; woh Aap ki taraf jhuke aur Aap se Banu Zufar ke do gharon ki hajat zikr ki. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Har ghar ke liye khajoor ka ek wasaq aur jau ka aadha [wasaq].' To Usaid bin Hudair ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Allah Aap ko hamari taraf se behtar jaza de. Yahya kehte hain: To Muhammad, yani Ibn Ibrahim bin Haris ka gumaan hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aur tum, to Allah tumhen jazae khair de Ai Ansar; beshak tum [mangne se] bachte hue sabr karne wale ho. Beshak tum mere ba'd mamle [maal] mein [ghairon ki] tarjeeh dekhoge; to sabr karo yahan tak ke mujh se milo [hauz par].'"
